WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.106 --> 01:37.900
=Episode 34=

01:48.320 --> 01:49.160
General Zhao.

01:56.080 --> 01:57.041
Eunuch Lian.

01:57.720 --> 01:59.401
Since your imprisonment,

01:59.561 --> 02:00.520
you have not pleaded innocence,

02:00.520 --> 02:01.440
nor appealed.

02:01.440 --> 02:02.720
Such composure

02:03.080 --> 02:04.240
truly makes me

02:04.440 --> 02:06.080
admire you.

02:07.401 --> 02:08.760
I trust His Majesty

02:11.440 --> 02:12.841
will not wrong an innocent man.

02:12.841 --> 02:14.081
His Majesty also trusts

02:14.081 --> 02:16.440
you would never collude with merchants.

02:16.841 --> 02:17.880
But the difficulty

02:17.880 --> 02:19.040
of this case

02:19.720 --> 02:20.880
lies elsewhere.

02:21.241 --> 02:23.001
Though His Majesty is the supreme ruler,

02:23.720 --> 02:24.760
there are times

02:25.320 --> 02:27.401
when even he cannot do as he wishes.

02:27.600 --> 02:29.401
He granted you the courtesy name Huchen,

02:29.561 --> 02:31.920
hoping you would serve him

02:31.920 --> 02:33.281
like a fierce tiger.

02:33.361 --> 02:35.040
That trust and regard

02:35.040 --> 02:36.600
are absolutely real.

02:42.841 --> 02:44.121
What does His Majesty mean?

02:45.040 --> 02:45.880
General Zhao,

02:46.281 --> 02:48.961
do you remember Madam Yan of Yongning?

02:49.720 --> 02:50.521
Yes.

02:52.121 --> 02:54.160
She served her husband for a lifetime.

02:59.040 --> 03:00.880
In the end, she was convicted
as his accomplice

03:02.841 --> 03:04.040
and executed with him.

03:04.361 --> 03:05.920
In ordinary households,

03:06.040 --> 03:07.040
all domestic affairs

03:07.440 --> 03:09.241
are handled by the wife, are they not?

03:10.121 --> 03:11.160
She handled

03:11.561 --> 03:12.841
the business dealings.

03:13.480 --> 03:14.401
She met

03:14.720 --> 03:16.001
the merchants.

03:16.640 --> 03:17.561
And she received

03:18.600 --> 03:20.521
the silver.

03:21.320 --> 03:23.281
You knew nothing of it all.

03:25.521 --> 03:27.281
But what if she is innocent?

03:27.600 --> 03:29.361
The moment she signs the confession,

03:29.681 --> 03:31.521
who will believe she is wronged?

03:32.121 --> 03:34.001
With a bowl of poison
poured down her throat,

03:34.600 --> 03:35.480
General Zhao,

03:35.480 --> 03:37.040
you will see the light of day again.

03:37.841 --> 03:40.121
His Majesty will grant you a chance
to redeem yourself.

03:40.801 --> 03:43.320
High rank, generous salary,
wealth and honor

03:43.320 --> 03:44.760
will still be yours.

03:45.241 --> 03:46.040
After all,

03:46.720 --> 03:47.361
you are

03:47.841 --> 03:50.040
His Majesty's Huchen.

03:51.040 --> 03:52.880
Your hands must remain clean.

03:54.081 --> 03:56.001
Lay low for a while,

03:56.241 --> 03:58.200
and you will still be restored to favor.

03:58.401 --> 03:59.440
Is that not how

03:59.961 --> 04:01.841
the Yu family protected

04:02.320 --> 04:03.920
Young Lord Yu?

04:14.801 --> 04:15.841
General Zhao,

04:17.440 --> 04:18.200
you

04:19.161 --> 04:21.161
must think this through carefully.

05:31.280 --> 05:32.280
Mr. Zhao.

05:55.200 --> 05:56.161
I'm fine.

05:56.241 --> 05:57.200
Madam Zhao.

05:57.880 --> 06:00.840
General Zhao fought his way
to the highest ranks.

06:01.080 --> 06:02.801
He earned it with his life.

06:03.601 --> 06:05.481
If such a small case

06:05.481 --> 06:07.041
brings him down,

06:07.161 --> 06:08.440
what a waste that would be.

06:09.400 --> 06:11.161
One bowl of medicine,

06:11.840 --> 06:12.481
and you

06:12.840 --> 06:15.161
can secure his future.

06:48.681 --> 06:50.640
When we first met,

06:52.041 --> 06:53.601
we were enemies.

06:54.760 --> 06:56.001
In Linchun Town,

06:57.681 --> 06:58.840
it was you

07:00.440 --> 07:02.440
who gave me a new path.

07:04.840 --> 07:06.241
The Yongning case

07:07.960 --> 07:09.880
gave me a chance to clear my name.

07:16.121 --> 07:17.561
Five years in Ganlin Town,

07:19.361 --> 07:21.440
you stayed with me from banner commander

07:24.801 --> 07:26.721
to a man
with distinguished military merits.

07:31.361 --> 07:32.400
In this life,

07:37.561 --> 07:39.440
I was fortunate to have you.

07:54.640 --> 07:55.760
In this life,

08:00.400 --> 08:02.320
I too was fortunate to have you.

09:21.361 --> 09:23.721
I saved you from Biyun Nunnery

09:25.601 --> 09:26.721
not to let you end up

09:26.721 --> 09:29.040
in another one.

09:37.280 --> 09:38.441
No!

09:40.123 --> 09:43.240
♪Shattered into dust thin♪

09:48.841 --> 09:50.040
Spit it out!

09:50.241 --> 09:52.001
Spit it out now!

09:52.481 --> 09:53.640
Spit it out!

09:53.920 --> 09:55.680
Spit it out now!

09:55.680 --> 09:56.601
Zhao Ling!

09:58.441 --> 10:00.001
Spit it out!

10:00.481 --> 10:02.321
Spit it out now!

10:05.201 --> 10:06.160
Quanhui.

10:09.441 --> 10:11.560
I will never

10:16.760 --> 10:18.201
abandon you.

10:20.841 --> 10:22.361
No!

10:22.423 --> 10:25.363
♪Clouds part, mists drift away♪

10:25.400 --> 10:28.481
Spit it out, Zhao Ling!

10:33.560 --> 10:34.201
Zhao Ling!

10:34.201 --> 10:35.001
Every matter,

10:35.280 --> 10:36.121
big or small,

10:36.841 --> 10:38.001
was done by me alone.

10:38.001 --> 10:38.880
They had nothing to do with it!

10:38.880 --> 10:39.520
Zhao Ling!

10:39.520 --> 10:40.321
I beg His Majesty for mercy.

10:40.321 --> 10:41.520
Zhao Ling!

10:41.520 --> 10:42.361
Spare them.

10:43.601 --> 10:44.841
I beg His Majesty for mercy.

10:45.760 --> 10:46.721
Spare them.

10:46.721 --> 10:47.880
I beg you.

10:48.241 --> 10:49.321
Save Zhao Ling. I beg you.

10:49.321 --> 10:50.160
Spare them.

10:50.400 --> 10:51.601
Save him.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.640
I beg you.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.081
Spare them.

10:55.601 --> 10:58.001
I beg you.

10:58.321 --> 10:59.520
Spare them.

11:07.560 --> 11:08.361
Here they come.

11:08.361 --> 11:09.001
They're out.

11:11.760 --> 11:12.481
Madam.

11:14.520 --> 11:15.280
Quanhui.

11:22.920 --> 11:23.481
Easy.

11:23.481 --> 11:24.160
Slow down.

11:26.001 --> 11:26.760
Madam,

11:28.721 --> 11:29.721
where is Mr. Zhao?

11:31.961 --> 11:33.081
Mr. Zhao

11:36.361 --> 11:37.321
is gone.

11:45.441 --> 11:46.321
What do you mean?

11:46.560 --> 11:47.321
What do you mean?

11:47.321 --> 11:48.280
What do you mean, gone?

11:52.160 --> 11:53.081
I'm going to find him.

11:53.081 --> 11:53.560
Sen.

11:53.560 --> 11:54.160
I'm going to find him.

11:54.160 --> 11:55.121
Sen, calm down.

11:55.721 --> 11:56.760
Quanhui, what do you mean?

11:56.920 --> 11:58.520
What do you mean, gone? Quanhui.

11:59.201 --> 12:00.160
What do you mean, gone?

12:01.160 --> 12:03.321
What's the point

12:05.560 --> 12:07.280
of living on alone?

12:09.400 --> 12:10.640
Don't think like that.

12:11.121 --> 12:12.520
Let me go with him.

12:15.640 --> 12:17.400
I'll join him in the afterlife!

12:17.400 --> 12:18.481
Fu Tingyun!

12:23.121 --> 12:24.241
Your man is gone,

12:26.321 --> 12:27.560
and you want to die with him?

12:27.560 --> 12:29.280
Who are you doing right by?

12:53.800 --> 12:54.400
My Lord,

12:54.560 --> 12:55.920
word has come from the imperial prison.

12:55.920 --> 12:57.280
Zhao Ling is dead.

12:59.160 --> 13:00.361
Dead?

13:02.721 --> 13:03.201
Just

13:03.201 --> 13:04.560
like that?

13:08.241 --> 13:10.241
That seems too easy.

13:13.961 --> 13:15.601
How did Fu Tingyun react?

13:16.040 --> 13:17.361
She nearly killed herself to follow him.

13:17.680 --> 13:19.680
The ladies from the Northwest
stopped her.

13:22.160 --> 13:22.800
Madam,

13:23.560 --> 13:24.481
you should go

13:25.680 --> 13:26.961
and feel them out.

13:50.241 --> 13:50.880
Young Master.

13:50.880 --> 13:51.560
Any news?

13:51.800 --> 13:53.680
Zhao Ling took his own life
in the imperial prison.

13:54.001 --> 13:55.520
Ninth Young Lady has been pardoned
and released.

13:55.680 --> 13:56.920
She is staying at the Xie shop for now.

14:00.721 --> 14:01.280
So she is

14:03.001 --> 14:03.920
truly safe.

14:06.201 --> 14:06.880
Young Master,

14:07.121 --> 14:09.121
shall I go to the Xie shop

14:09.121 --> 14:09.961
and find out for you?

14:37.760 --> 14:38.920
Have some water first,

14:38.920 --> 14:39.560
Madam.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.121
Tingyun,

14:47.441 --> 14:49.081
if it hurts too much,

14:50.680 --> 14:52.280
you can cry.

14:53.640 --> 14:54.760
Stay strong.

15:01.841 --> 15:02.760
How do you plan to arrange

15:03.361 --> 15:04.560
the funeral?

15:06.040 --> 15:07.321
We should start preparing.

15:14.721 --> 15:16.321
I haven't given it much thought.

15:17.961 --> 15:18.721
I understand.

15:20.441 --> 15:21.441
Before,

15:21.880 --> 15:23.441
you had someone

15:24.640 --> 15:26.081
to discuss things with.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.001
Now,

15:30.081 --> 15:32.081
you are the only one left in charge.

15:33.721 --> 15:34.880
But these things

15:35.680 --> 15:36.880
still need to be arranged.

15:39.361 --> 15:40.721
Let me help you.

15:42.361 --> 15:43.121
Right.

15:43.121 --> 15:44.001
Once you've done it before,

15:44.001 --> 15:44.880
you'll get the hang of it.

15:45.241 --> 15:46.081
Don't worry.

15:46.201 --> 15:47.640
Madam Mo has experience.

15:48.841 --> 15:49.441
I'll handle it.

15:49.601 --> 15:50.441
I have experience.

15:51.321 --> 15:53.081
When Yu Xiaoqi died,

15:53.680 --> 15:54.640
I was alone too.

16:02.640 --> 16:03.520
Zhao Ling

16:04.361 --> 16:05.601
has not yet been convicted.

16:07.481 --> 16:08.481
The funerary banner

16:09.201 --> 16:10.640
must follow the third-rank standard.

16:11.920 --> 16:12.800
His Majesty

16:13.441 --> 16:14.601
has granted him a proper burial.

16:14.841 --> 16:16.081
So the dignity he deserves

16:16.481 --> 16:17.680
must be upheld.

16:21.081 --> 16:21.961
Sister,

16:22.760 --> 16:24.640
there is something else.

16:24.640 --> 16:25.321
Don't say it.

16:26.400 --> 16:27.121
I understand.

16:28.800 --> 16:29.560
Now,

16:33.560 --> 16:35.121
we are both the same.

16:36.680 --> 16:37.800
The past

16:38.800 --> 16:39.841
is best left unspoken.

16:41.201 --> 16:42.800
Let's get through this first.

16:51.920 --> 16:53.001
We women

16:54.040 --> 16:55.680
must learn to take care of ourselves.

16:57.081 --> 16:57.920
Zhao Ling

16:58.961 --> 17:00.361
gave his life to protect you.

17:02.800 --> 17:04.401
So you must live well.

17:04.721 --> 17:05.600
You must hold on.

17:06.201 --> 17:07.320
Just like Mo Yi

17:11.681 --> 17:13.320
gave his life to protect me.

17:16.161 --> 17:17.961
I must live well too.

17:36.637 --> 17:39.536
(Coffin of the Late General Zhaoyong,
Zhao Ling)

17:39.556 --> 17:45.883
(In Memoriam)

18:10.823 --> 18:12.680
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Husband,
General Zhaoyong Zhao Ling)

18:46.401 --> 18:47.241
My condolences.

18:50.181 --> 18:55.180
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

19:07.040 --> 19:08.840
Madam Yu has arrived.

19:27.077 --> 19:29.160
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Husband,
General Zhaoyong Zhao Ling)

19:39.241 --> 19:40.441
As is customary,

19:40.681 --> 19:42.401
I have prepared sacrificial offerings,

19:42.681 --> 19:44.161
hand-copied rebirth mantras,

19:44.161 --> 19:45.520
and plain white silk brocade

19:45.760 --> 19:46.961
as my condolence gifts.

19:58.840 --> 19:59.760
Madam Zhao,

20:01.600 --> 20:03.360
how are you holding up?

20:37.800 --> 20:38.681
Madam Yu,

20:40.001 --> 20:41.401
my husband Zhao Ling

20:42.161 --> 20:43.481
died unjustly in prison

20:45.520 --> 20:47.201
without a proper trial.

20:48.241 --> 20:50.560
I am his lawfully wedded wife.

20:51.280 --> 20:52.481
One day,

20:55.001 --> 20:57.161
I will clear his name.

21:01.760 --> 21:02.921
Madam Zhao,

21:03.360 --> 21:05.201
neither of us is naive.

21:06.961 --> 21:08.600
This performance of yours today...

21:09.001 --> 21:10.600
Is it for the funeral,

21:10.600 --> 21:12.001
or is it an act?

21:12.800 --> 21:14.481
We both know the truth.

21:16.961 --> 21:19.280
If you truly wish
to see this act through,

21:21.481 --> 21:23.481
I do have something

21:23.681 --> 21:25.241
to add to your performance.

21:31.961 --> 21:33.881
The common folk's Chastity Tonic

21:33.881 --> 21:35.080
has a harsh recipe.

21:35.441 --> 21:36.681
It is too painful.

21:37.520 --> 21:40.001
I had a milder version prepared for you.

21:40.280 --> 21:42.080
It will make your beauty fade too soon

21:42.161 --> 21:43.441
and make childbearing difficult.

21:45.441 --> 21:47.520
If you insist you are a widow,

21:49.320 --> 21:51.001
you will surely have use for it.

21:58.201 --> 21:59.600
How dare you torment her like this?

21:59.921 --> 22:01.161
There is no such rule in the Northwest.

22:01.401 --> 22:02.600
My sister here

22:02.600 --> 22:03.800
can remain a widow,

22:03.800 --> 22:04.961
remarry,

22:04.961 --> 22:06.481
or have children, as she pleases.

22:06.560 --> 22:07.481
Who do you think you are

22:07.481 --> 22:08.360
to dictate to her?

22:17.001 --> 22:18.641
You pride yourself on your refinement,

22:19.360 --> 22:22.120
yet you stoop to scheme with me,

22:23.120 --> 22:24.800
offering poison as a gift

22:26.641 --> 22:27.921
and without shame.

22:46.800 --> 22:47.921
Madam, no.

23:00.080 --> 23:02.120
It was just a bit of teasing.

23:02.481 --> 23:03.840
You took it too seriously.

23:04.600 --> 23:06.001
At your age,

23:06.520 --> 23:08.040
who would really want to harm you?

23:09.241 --> 23:11.520
I did not come here to fight you.

23:12.080 --> 23:13.961
I came to offer you some advice.

23:14.721 --> 23:16.360
The court

23:17.481 --> 23:19.360
has seen the last of Zhao Ling.

23:21.760 --> 23:23.080
Stopping here

23:23.760 --> 23:25.001
is just right.

23:25.961 --> 23:28.080
If you try to stir up more trouble,

23:28.520 --> 23:30.441
what awaits you in the end

23:32.360 --> 23:35.760
may be far worse
than this bowl of Chastity Tonic.

23:55.961 --> 23:57.840
Let me give you
one more piece of advice.

24:00.241 --> 24:01.840
In this life,

24:03.001 --> 24:05.721
what you end up holding onto
are these things.

24:07.080 --> 24:08.800
If you wish to stand at the top,

24:09.001 --> 24:10.600
and stand there long,

24:11.241 --> 24:13.401
you must give up something,

24:15.040 --> 24:16.520
such as kindness,

24:17.441 --> 24:19.161
or true feelings.

24:19.721 --> 24:21.241
If you want to stay alive,

24:22.201 --> 24:23.721
stop here.

24:25.360 --> 24:26.560
Right here.

24:42.520 --> 24:43.681
What kind of person is this?

24:43.881 --> 24:44.921
General Zhao's already dead,

24:45.001 --> 24:45.961
and she still pulls this stunt.

24:48.161 --> 24:48.800
Tingyun.

25:06.881 --> 25:08.120
Found anything?

25:08.921 --> 25:10.161
The coffin was sealed.

25:10.560 --> 25:12.080
I didn't see Zhao Ling's body.

25:13.241 --> 25:14.840
But that no longer matters.

25:15.280 --> 25:17.681
It's likely a diversion.

25:19.600 --> 25:20.840
His Majesty

25:20.840 --> 25:22.681
has Zhao Ling working in secret.

25:22.921 --> 25:24.241
If he finds anything,

25:24.241 --> 25:25.360
I will be the one to die.

25:25.600 --> 25:26.721
And Zhao Ling

25:26.921 --> 25:28.201
bears the humiliation,

25:28.201 --> 25:30.241
completes his mission,
and repays the Emperor.

25:31.241 --> 25:32.881
If he finds nothing,

25:32.881 --> 25:34.080
then he dies.

25:34.721 --> 25:36.001
The Emperor and I

25:36.080 --> 25:38.800
can still appear to be harmonious.

25:39.161 --> 25:40.600
For His Majesty,

25:40.600 --> 25:41.840
there is no loss either way.

25:43.161 --> 25:44.800
What matters now

25:44.800 --> 25:46.001
is to find out

25:46.001 --> 25:48.320
what Zhao Ling has really been up to.

25:48.800 --> 25:49.881
Rest assured, Master.

25:50.201 --> 25:51.241
I have already

25:51.360 --> 25:52.641
had the Xie shop watched.

26:00.881 --> 26:01.441
Father.

26:02.161 --> 26:02.721
Mother.

26:07.681 --> 26:09.320
Learn from your father.

26:14.241 --> 26:15.161
What

26:16.681 --> 26:17.721
have you been doing?

26:18.520 --> 26:19.600
I've just been

26:20.881 --> 26:22.120
studying the classics.

26:24.040 --> 26:25.360
Away from the court,

26:26.040 --> 26:27.961
I've lost my hunger for fame and profit.

26:28.120 --> 26:29.401
I feel much more at ease.

26:30.840 --> 26:32.641
You've never truly held power,

26:34.641 --> 26:36.560
yet you claim to be tired of it.

26:38.360 --> 26:39.760
I grew up surrounded by it.

26:40.961 --> 26:42.161
Nothing about it feels new.

26:55.481 --> 26:56.520
Anzhou,

26:56.520 --> 26:57.481
Yuzhou,

26:58.481 --> 27:00.040
Yongning Prefecture.

27:00.560 --> 27:01.921
These three places,

27:02.441 --> 27:03.760
starting today,

27:04.481 --> 27:05.881
salt prices will rise.

27:06.961 --> 27:07.840
At least

27:07.961 --> 27:09.360
eighty copper coins per catty.

27:11.481 --> 27:13.080
You've studied arithmetic

27:13.080 --> 27:14.241
since you were three.

27:14.881 --> 27:17.080
Reading accounts and estimating value
is nothing for you.

27:17.241 --> 27:18.241
So tell me,

27:18.681 --> 27:19.881
after the price change,

27:20.560 --> 27:23.360
how much more will the Yu family
earn in a year?

27:24.120 --> 27:25.120
At least

27:25.840 --> 27:26.840
fifty thousand taels.

27:29.800 --> 27:30.481
Good.

27:32.040 --> 27:34.001
I say raise it by eighty.

27:34.881 --> 27:35.681
The salt price

27:36.201 --> 27:37.681
will not be any lower.

27:37.760 --> 27:39.800
I say start with these places,

27:40.040 --> 27:43.040
and no one below will dare deviate.

27:43.201 --> 27:45.080
I say a catty is not a catty,

27:45.520 --> 27:47.201
but one catty and seven taels.

27:47.201 --> 27:49.681
And the world will accept it.

27:54.161 --> 27:55.681
You were born into the Yu family.

27:55.681 --> 27:57.360
You've known wealth and luxury
since childhood.

27:58.881 --> 28:00.161
What you possess

28:00.520 --> 28:02.040
is what others could never earn

28:02.040 --> 28:03.641
in several lifetimes.

28:03.641 --> 28:05.241
You were born with it.

28:08.161 --> 28:09.881
Do you know why Zhao Ling and I

28:10.001 --> 28:11.401
are locked in this

28:12.161 --> 28:13.401
fight to the death?

28:14.560 --> 28:17.001
Is it because of that woman
you've been thinking about?

28:19.360 --> 28:21.001
Some want to climb up.

28:21.760 --> 28:23.760
Others fear being replaced.

28:23.881 --> 28:25.161
It's that simple.

28:26.120 --> 28:27.161
And you,

28:27.560 --> 28:28.641
my son,

28:29.840 --> 28:32.280
do you wish to enjoy wealth and glory

28:32.280 --> 28:33.921
or be pushed around?

28:39.520 --> 28:40.681
This is the last time

28:40.800 --> 28:43.080
I will speak to you like this.

28:43.560 --> 28:45.320
Keep this in mind.

28:46.560 --> 28:47.120
Yes.

28:49.001 --> 28:49.961
I understand, Father.

28:56.881 --> 28:57.520
My Lord.

28:57.721 --> 28:58.600
Lord Wei from the Ministry of Personnel

28:58.600 --> 28:59.760
has come with pastries to see you.

29:01.080 --> 29:03.641
His father-in-law is making things
difficult for me.

29:04.520 --> 29:05.760
Why is he here?

29:06.481 --> 29:07.320
Do you see?

29:08.721 --> 29:09.681
Power

29:10.520 --> 29:12.401
makes thousands come to beg you,

29:12.600 --> 29:13.441
not

29:13.800 --> 29:15.441
the other way around.

29:27.130 --> 29:29.543
(Map)

29:29.576 --> 29:30.190
(Anzhou Xie Shop)

29:30.201 --> 29:30.961
(Anzhou)
My apologies,

29:30.961 --> 29:32.001
(Anzhou)
you two.

29:32.001 --> 29:32.881
We are closed today.

29:42.001 --> 29:42.560
Who is it?

29:42.641 --> 29:43.481
I'm one of you.

30:04.161 --> 30:05.441
Do you recognize this bracelet?

30:08.241 --> 30:08.921
Mr. Zhao.

30:09.881 --> 30:11.441
(Shen Congsi)
Previously, all letters from Lord Shen

30:11.441 --> 30:12.800
passed through this shop

30:12.921 --> 30:14.280
to reach you.

30:14.441 --> 30:15.441
But two months ago,

30:15.441 --> 30:16.921
Anzhou's mail was strictly controlled.

30:17.280 --> 30:18.600
This letter could not be sent.

30:18.681 --> 30:20.520
Lord Shen left it here,

30:20.520 --> 30:21.161
and soon after,

30:21.161 --> 30:22.001
he died suddenly.

30:22.001 --> 30:22.840
This letter

30:22.840 --> 30:24.080
became his final words.

30:24.401 --> 30:26.401
(I thoroughly investigated
Anzhou's corrupt salt system.)

30:26.401 --> 30:27.641
(Besides the granary loss fraud,)

30:27.641 --> 30:29.481
(I uncovered another monstrous scheme.)

30:29.721 --> 30:32.080
(The official weights used in Anzhou
are fraudulent.)

30:32.280 --> 30:33.481
(Their outer shells are iron,)

30:33.481 --> 30:34.721
(but inside, they are copper.)

30:34.721 --> 30:36.080
(They are called Golden Weights.)

30:36.441 --> 30:38.120
(Salt merchants deliver
one catty and seven taels,)

30:38.120 --> 30:39.040
(but it is recorded as one catty.)

30:39.401 --> 30:40.600
(The seven-tael difference,)

30:40.600 --> 30:41.560
(day after day, month after month,)

30:41.560 --> 30:42.921
(ruins the salt merchants entirely.)

30:42.921 --> 30:44.241
(They are forced to raise salt prices.)

30:44.520 --> 30:45.961
(The common people
can no longer afford salt.)

30:45.961 --> 30:47.641
(The source of this evil lies
within Anzhou's officials.)

30:47.641 --> 30:49.001
(Shen Congsi)
(But I have already alarmed them.)

30:49.001 --> 30:50.001
(Shen Congsi)
(I fear I will not survive.)

30:50.001 --> 30:50.320
(Yet)

30:50.441 --> 30:51.681
(to plead for the people's cause,)

30:51.681 --> 30:52.721
(even death is without regret.)

30:52.721 --> 30:54.080
(If anyone should read this letter,)

30:54.241 --> 30:56.320
(Shen Congsi)
(may they carry on and see it through.)

30:56.320 --> 30:57.401
The key to this case

30:57.760 --> 30:59.001
is still the Golden Weights.

30:59.760 --> 31:01.320
But with our resources,

31:02.921 --> 31:04.481
to take on such a powerful foe,

31:07.961 --> 31:09.641
it seems we must go back
to our old ways.

31:12.600 --> 31:14.481
Young Lord Qin, we need your help.

31:14.800 --> 31:15.520
With what?

31:15.961 --> 31:16.840
You will go

31:17.080 --> 31:18.280
to Minzhou

31:19.360 --> 31:21.280
and borrow some official salt.

31:23.600 --> 31:24.840
I beg His Majesty for mercy!

31:24.840 --> 31:25.800
I beg you.

31:25.800 --> 31:26.280
Spare them!

31:26.280 --> 31:28.241
I beg you. Save Zhao Ling!

31:28.241 --> 31:29.961
I beg you. Save him!

31:29.961 --> 31:31.481
I granted you the courtesy name Huchen,

31:31.760 --> 31:33.161
and I did not misjudge you after all.

31:34.040 --> 31:34.881
General Zhao,

31:35.560 --> 31:36.800
straighten yourself up.

31:37.840 --> 31:40.080
That was just an ordinary tonic.

31:50.120 --> 31:50.600
Come on.

31:54.080 --> 31:54.881
Good.

31:55.441 --> 31:57.001
I have observed that many couples

31:57.280 --> 31:58.681
abandon each other in times of crisis.

31:59.080 --> 32:00.401
But a couple like you,

32:00.401 --> 32:01.481
who stand together

32:01.481 --> 32:02.401
through life and death,

32:02.560 --> 32:03.721
is truly rare.

32:04.320 --> 32:05.201
You have integrity

32:05.201 --> 32:05.961
and loyalty.

32:06.201 --> 32:07.441
You are worthy of my blessing.

32:09.690 --> 32:10.536
(Report on the Death
of Imperial Salt Censor Shen Congsi)

32:10.560 --> 32:11.040
Look.

32:12.910 --> 32:14.030
(Report on the Death
of Imperial Salt Censor Shen Congsi)

32:14.070 --> 32:15.610
(He died of illness in Anzhou.)

32:18.800 --> 32:19.961
They claim it was an illness,

32:20.161 --> 32:21.241
but I do not believe it.

32:21.481 --> 32:22.241
And

32:22.241 --> 32:24.040
I know one more thing.

32:24.881 --> 32:26.320
During the old salt law,

32:26.600 --> 32:29.001
a so-called Golden Weight was used
throughout the realm.

32:29.360 --> 32:31.120
One catty and seven taels of grain

32:31.120 --> 32:32.520
would be weighed as just one catty.

32:33.280 --> 32:34.520
The surplus

32:34.520 --> 32:36.560
mostly ended up in Yu Guodong's pockets.

32:38.001 --> 32:39.241
I want to bring him down,

32:39.360 --> 32:40.721
but he has many allies

32:40.721 --> 32:41.681
in key positions.

32:41.681 --> 32:42.401
So

32:42.600 --> 32:43.881
I have hesitated.

32:44.320 --> 32:45.921
But he has only grown bolder.

32:46.280 --> 32:47.401
I may not have liked

32:47.881 --> 32:48.921
Shen Congsi,

32:49.001 --> 32:50.080
but he was an imperial censor.

32:50.360 --> 32:51.080
They

32:51.360 --> 32:52.560
dared to kill an imperial censor.

32:53.241 --> 32:55.641
So you imprisoned us both,

32:56.760 --> 32:58.320
raided the Zhao Residence,

32:59.120 --> 33:00.080
all to...

33:00.721 --> 33:01.881
To make a show of one thing

33:02.280 --> 33:03.481
while secretly doing another.

33:04.040 --> 33:04.641
Zhao Ling,

33:05.280 --> 33:06.241
I ask you

33:06.760 --> 33:08.120
to do what you did

33:08.120 --> 33:09.241
in Yongning,

33:09.560 --> 33:10.641
and bring down the Yu family.

33:11.201 --> 33:11.840
Do you

33:12.241 --> 33:13.201
have a way?

33:17.641 --> 33:19.481
Since Huchen could not work,

33:22.800 --> 33:24.161
then Zhao Ling is out too.

33:27.560 --> 33:29.681
Since this concerns salt,

33:35.641 --> 33:37.241
perhaps Jiuweijiao could.

33:38.760 --> 33:39.560
Good.

33:47.080 --> 33:47.961
Sister.

33:50.401 --> 33:51.600
Between us,

33:51.721 --> 33:53.241
there is no need for such formality.

33:53.800 --> 33:54.360
Let's drink.

34:01.800 --> 34:03.881
I want to tell you something today.

34:05.360 --> 34:06.721
Mr. Zhao is not actually dead.

34:12.160 --> 34:12.640
Not...

34:13.160 --> 34:14.080
Not dead?

34:19.441 --> 34:20.801
He left the capital in secret

34:23.001 --> 34:24.200
to investigate the case.

34:25.801 --> 34:26.961
But right now,

34:27.080 --> 34:28.361
he is in grave danger.

34:29.160 --> 34:30.640
If he cannot find solid evidence,

34:31.160 --> 34:32.040
he will never be able

34:32.881 --> 34:34.640
to return to the capital.

34:34.961 --> 34:36.200
From then on,

34:37.680 --> 34:39.481
he may have to live as a salt trader.

34:46.401 --> 34:47.560
It's good that he's not dead.

34:55.600 --> 34:57.520
I didn't mean to keep this from you.

34:57.841 --> 34:59.281
I thought

34:59.281 --> 35:00.761
the fewer who knew, the better.

35:01.080 --> 35:02.160
The grieving act

35:03.040 --> 35:04.481
must be as convincing as possible.

35:10.921 --> 35:11.560
I understand.

35:14.001 --> 35:16.160
Why don't you scold me, sister?

35:16.680 --> 35:18.160
Please, scold me.

35:26.600 --> 35:27.881
It may sound terrible,

35:29.080 --> 35:30.961
but knowing someone shared my pain

35:31.640 --> 35:33.040
somehow brought me comfort.

35:34.321 --> 35:35.361
And now,

35:36.240 --> 35:38.160
knowing that General Zhao is alive,

35:40.481 --> 35:41.761
I truly feel glad.

35:44.761 --> 35:45.921
In this world,

35:49.240 --> 35:52.080
there is one less broken heart.

36:03.841 --> 36:05.600
Thank you for telling me this.

36:08.881 --> 36:09.560
Thank you.

36:16.921 --> 36:18.401
I have failed you.

36:20.761 --> 36:21.600
Back then,

36:22.600 --> 36:25.080
I truly wanted to save General Mo.

36:27.321 --> 36:29.240
But His Majesty's decision was final

36:29.560 --> 36:31.361
and Mr. Zhao had no choice either.

36:35.921 --> 36:37.481
I understood that long ago.

36:39.001 --> 36:40.881
My anger toward you

36:42.160 --> 36:44.560
was just me looking for someone
to blame.

36:45.401 --> 36:47.040
I was the one

36:49.200 --> 36:51.640
truly to blame, for pushing him

36:52.281 --> 36:54.881
to chase fame and status.

37:09.160 --> 37:10.520
Fine as snow,

37:10.520 --> 37:11.520
white as frost.

37:12.321 --> 37:13.921
Where did you get such good stock?

37:14.401 --> 37:15.720
Have you heard of Ground Snow?

37:16.120 --> 37:18.040
A refining method from the Northwest.

37:18.441 --> 37:19.801
Almost as good as official salt,

37:19.801 --> 37:21.200
only thirty copper coins per catty.

37:21.321 --> 37:22.720
Thirty copper coins?

37:22.961 --> 37:23.321
This...

37:23.520 --> 37:24.841
The current market price

37:24.921 --> 37:26.401
is already eighty.

37:26.401 --> 37:28.040
We're new here.

37:28.240 --> 37:29.160
Just trying to make a living.

37:29.441 --> 37:30.281
We want

37:30.281 --> 37:31.401
to open up the market.

37:32.200 --> 37:33.600
I have good stock here

37:33.600 --> 37:34.881
for thirty copper coins per catty.

37:34.881 --> 37:35.720
Thirty copper coins?

37:35.720 --> 37:36.600
Don't lie to me.

37:36.600 --> 37:37.401
How is that possible?

37:37.401 --> 37:39.200
Not only is it over half cheaper,

37:39.200 --> 37:40.321
but it's top quality too.

37:42.801 --> 37:44.600
Who are you two,

37:44.841 --> 37:46.961
daring to cause trouble in Anzhou?

37:47.240 --> 37:49.040
You take on any business
that comes your way, don't you?

37:49.240 --> 37:50.401
Didn't you bother to ask

37:50.401 --> 37:51.881
whose protection we're under?

37:55.520 --> 37:56.921
You dare touch my men?

37:58.040 --> 37:59.801
Don't you know
they're under my protection?

37:59.801 --> 38:00.600
Who are you?

38:03.321 --> 38:04.441
Jiu

38:04.921 --> 38:05.921
wei

38:06.481 --> 38:07.200
jiao.

38:07.401 --> 38:08.401
What Jiuweijiao?

38:08.401 --> 38:09.401
Don't move.

38:10.441 --> 38:11.040
Stay still.

38:11.160 --> 38:11.640
Don't move!

38:13.680 --> 38:14.240
Don't move!

38:17.040 --> 38:17.321
Come here.

38:17.321 --> 38:18.160
Steal our business,

38:18.160 --> 38:19.321
and now you want to steal our goods too?

38:26.040 --> 38:28.200
This low-grade salt of yours

38:32.001 --> 38:34.401
isn't even fit to pave the road for us.

38:36.200 --> 38:36.961
Someone, come here.

38:38.240 --> 38:39.600
Dump the salt into the water.

38:39.600 --> 38:40.481
Better to sink the boat

38:40.481 --> 38:41.281
than lose the salt!

38:41.560 --> 38:43.001
Don't push it too far!

38:44.520 --> 38:45.600
Sink it.

38:48.040 --> 38:48.680
You...

38:51.680 --> 38:52.240
You

38:52.240 --> 38:53.321
steal business,

38:53.321 --> 38:54.560
and now you want to take the pier too?

38:54.560 --> 38:56.160
Did you ask those above us?

39:01.441 --> 39:02.481
Those above you?

39:04.001 --> 39:04.720
Who?

39:07.120 --> 39:09.240
Want to call them out and have a chat?

39:12.720 --> 39:13.961
Let's see

39:15.441 --> 39:17.080
whose backing

39:21.961 --> 39:23.441
is stronger.

39:24.720 --> 39:25.361
My Lord.

39:26.080 --> 39:26.921
A salt smuggler

39:26.921 --> 39:28.560
has recently come to Anzhou.

39:28.841 --> 39:29.560
He goes by

39:29.560 --> 39:30.361
Jiuweijiao.

39:30.481 --> 39:31.801
He has good salt

39:32.240 --> 39:33.120
and sells it cheap.

39:33.600 --> 39:34.841
If this continues,

39:35.200 --> 39:36.481
(Anzhou, Prefect Liu)
I'm afraid

39:37.046 --> 39:38.726
we will have little left to offer you.

39:39.802 --> 39:41.020
(Five hundred taels)

39:44.640 --> 39:46.001
What's the big deal?

39:46.200 --> 39:48.680
I'll send someone to get rid of him.

39:49.281 --> 39:50.120
Thank you, My Lord.

39:52.560 --> 39:54.001
Who

39:54.361 --> 39:55.441
is this Jiuweijiao?

39:55.441 --> 39:57.841
He smuggled salt in the Northwest
years ago.

39:58.001 --> 39:59.481
He has a big name in Jianghu.

40:00.361 --> 40:01.720
I've already sent men

40:01.921 --> 40:02.881
to the Northwest

40:02.881 --> 40:03.961
to look into his background.

40:04.080 --> 40:05.240
For now,

40:06.600 --> 40:07.640
do you think

40:07.841 --> 40:08.680
we should

40:08.921 --> 40:10.401
teach him a lesson?

40:13.120 --> 40:14.680
He has good salt

40:15.080 --> 40:16.481
and sells it cheap.

40:17.401 --> 40:19.441
He can sell to anyone, can't he?

40:22.761 --> 40:24.761
I've sold smuggled salt as official salt

40:24.881 --> 40:25.881
plenty of times.

40:26.361 --> 40:28.560
But selling official salt
as smuggled salt?

40:28.640 --> 40:30.001
That's a first for me.

40:30.401 --> 40:31.240
Right.

40:31.321 --> 40:32.640
Then you should thank Lord Qin.

40:33.281 --> 40:35.040
He borrowed official salt
from Minzhou for us.

40:35.240 --> 40:37.001
His Majesty personally instructed me

40:37.321 --> 40:38.160
to give you

40:38.160 --> 40:39.120
my full support on this trip.

40:39.481 --> 40:40.520
Opening a couple of salt warehouses

40:40.600 --> 40:41.401
is no trouble at all.

40:42.720 --> 40:44.481
Well then,

40:45.881 --> 40:47.040
I have one more favor to ask.

40:48.080 --> 40:48.921
What do you want?

40:49.281 --> 40:50.600
Help me block a water route.

40:52.001 --> 40:53.881
That's a bit much to ask.

40:54.240 --> 40:56.001
Jiuweijiao thrived in the Northwest

40:56.001 --> 40:57.680
because he had his own smuggling routes.

40:58.481 --> 41:00.401
We need to show them our routes

41:00.761 --> 41:01.961
and make the act real.

41:02.841 --> 41:04.401
This is different from borrowing salt.

41:04.720 --> 41:06.600
I can't just block a water route
on a whim.

41:08.160 --> 41:09.001
Please go upstairs.

41:09.001 --> 41:09.520
Alright.

41:11.040 --> 41:12.080
The fish has taken the bait.

41:16.520 --> 41:17.921
Then we'll play it by ear.

41:19.200 --> 41:20.481
You're something else.

41:20.720 --> 41:21.680
Out here,

41:22.040 --> 41:23.640
you are whoever you say you are.

41:32.200 --> 41:33.281
My lord

41:33.761 --> 41:35.441
invites you to his residence, Mr. Jiu.

41:38.083 --> 41:38.563
(Invitation)

41:38.590 --> 41:39.690
(Prefect Liu Wenyuan of Anzhou invites)

41:39.720 --> 41:41.200
(Mr. Jiu for tea and a discussion.)
Since Prefect Liu invites me,

41:41.520 --> 41:43.281
I must receive him with proper ceremony.

41:45.600 --> 41:46.841
We'll find a place

41:47.200 --> 41:48.160
to host him.

41:48.321 --> 41:49.160
Then

41:50.120 --> 41:51.321
we'll invite him over.

41:51.321 --> 41:52.640
Where will you host him?

41:54.640 --> 41:55.321
On the An River.

41:55.560 --> 41:56.961
On a cargo boat?

41:56.961 --> 41:58.281
We won't just show the goods.

41:59.040 --> 42:00.080
We also want him

42:00.361 --> 42:01.600
to see our routes.

42:01.921 --> 42:03.281
Without real strength,

42:03.441 --> 42:06.281
how could we survive in Anzhou's trade?

42:16.080 --> 42:17.200
Put everything down!

42:17.600 --> 42:18.281
Don't move!

42:19.001 --> 42:20.240
Patrol inspection!

42:26.361 --> 42:27.720
Under Lord Ruan, I presume?

42:29.921 --> 42:31.321
We're on the same side.

42:31.881 --> 42:32.921
You should choose

42:33.160 --> 42:34.441
a better time to move goods!

42:34.441 --> 42:34.921
Yes.

42:35.240 --> 42:35.921
Got it.

42:35.921 --> 42:36.401
Let's go.

42:44.801 --> 42:46.281
I won't ask

42:46.441 --> 42:47.881
about your connections.

42:48.240 --> 42:49.640
But I will tell you

42:50.160 --> 42:51.720
who mine are.

42:52.137 --> 42:52.530
Oh?

42:57.361 --> 43:00.120
Thanks to the Yu family's favor,

43:00.801 --> 43:02.401
I get to enjoy such fine food

43:02.401 --> 43:04.680
here in Anzhou.

43:08.560 --> 43:09.961
Now you've seen my connections.

43:10.600 --> 43:11.520
I'll do business

43:13.361 --> 43:14.281
with you.

43:14.801 --> 43:15.520
But

43:16.001 --> 43:17.200
thirty copper coins per catty

43:17.520 --> 43:19.040
is not negotiable.

43:19.921 --> 43:21.761
Otherwise, I can't answer to my men.

43:27.080 --> 43:28.801
If you're not agreeable,

43:29.120 --> 43:30.520
I can always follow the An River

43:31.080 --> 43:32.841
and seek my fortune in Minzhou.

43:34.281 --> 43:34.881
Fine.

43:35.961 --> 43:37.481
Thirty copper coins, then.

43:38.600 --> 43:39.640
But

43:41.361 --> 43:42.841
we'll use my scale.

43:45.120 --> 43:46.120
Deal.

43:50.370 --> 43:52.910
(Next Episode)

43:53.600 --> 43:54.600
No matter what,

43:54.720 --> 43:57.321
I will expose the Yu family's lies

43:58.040 --> 43:59.640
and give the people the justice
they deserve.

43:59.921 --> 44:01.361
At any cost,

44:01.361 --> 44:02.560
Zhao Ling must not

44:02.640 --> 44:03.881
return to the capital alive.

44:09.240 --> 44:10.040
Madam,

44:10.481 --> 44:11.921
you don't have much time left.

44:12.040 --> 44:12.921
I beg you, Madam,

44:13.080 --> 44:14.481
to help him through the final stretch

44:14.481 --> 44:15.441
and see him safely to the capital.

44:15.481 --> 44:16.640
This court

44:16.640 --> 44:19.200
would be entirely
under Grand Secretary Yu's control.

44:19.600 --> 44:20.961
We're burning time.

44:21.600 --> 44:22.841
She's burning money.

44:23.441 --> 44:25.481
We'll see who gives in first.

44:38.240 --> 44:42.560
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

44:46.160 --> 44:50.520
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:52.640 --> 44:57.280
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:57.520 --> 45:00.320
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:01.480 --> 45:06.120
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:09.320 --> 45:16.160
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:17.040 --> 45:23.560
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:24.520 --> 45:27.960
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:28.480 --> 45:32.680
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:32.960 --> 45:38.640
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:50.760 --> 45:54.640
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

45:58.560 --> 46:02.560
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

46:04.280 --> 46:08.960
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:09.280 --> 46:11.960
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:13.040 --> 46:17.880
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:21.400 --> 46:28.320
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:29.200 --> 46:35.680
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

46:36.560 --> 46:40.080
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:40.520 --> 46:44.880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:45.080 --> 46:50.800
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
